OL,5,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,6,     FSoweto Kinch returns with another
OL,7,     Fweek of the best in jazz, and he
OL,8,     Fwelcomes London-born saxophonist
OL,9,     Fand arranger Alex Hitchcock as his
OL,10,     FFlowers guest from Monday to
OL,11,     FThursday.
OL,12,G0030 Through the Night
OL,13,     FMidori is the soloist in Dvorak's
OL,14,     FViolin Concerto with the German
OL,15,     FSymphony Orchestra, Berlin. The
OL,16,     Fprogramme features 'Earworms' by
OL,17,     FVivian Fung and Amy Beach's
OL,18,     F'Gaelic' Symphony.
